# Build contexts are the repo root (apps/core and apps/public both depend
# on the workspace), so this list is what never belongs in any image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
.git
data
uploads

# The development secrets file. It is gitignored, so it would not reach a
# clone — but it does reach a local `docker compose build`, and the
# Cloudflare plugin copies it into the build output, where it would then
# win over the value the container is actually given. A cookie-signing key
# baked into an image is exactly the failure this file exists to prevent.
**/.dev.vars
**/.wrangler
**/.react-router
.env
